BEFORE the loop; test.js gains string-form regression cases only. Original file preserved at
benchmark/replacements_2026-10-11/PCBV2-0044/patch_real.diff.orig (see MANIFEST.md there).

diff --git a/jsonpointer.js b/jsonpointer.js
